OL,3,GNEWSAMotorcyclist dies in hospital
OL,4,Aafter wall crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA motorcyclist has died two days after
OL,7,Fhis bike hit a wall in West Yorkshire.
OL,9,FThe 65-year-old man's motorbike struck
OL,10,Fthe kerb before hitting a wall in
OL,11,FOxenhope on Sunday. He died in hospital
OL,12,Fon Tuesday, according to West Yorkshire
OL,13,FPolice.
OL,15,FThe silver Suzuki SV1000 K3 motorbike
OL,16,Fcame off Hebden Bridge Road while
OL,17,Ftravelling towards Hill House Edge Lane
OL,18,Fat about 16:45 BST.
OL,20,FPolice urged any witnesses or anyone
OL,21,Fwith footage to come forward.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
